                        "entry_id": "ddb5ee84-2be4-3494-b524-bc289b288422",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A (usually major, often male) fan of the animated television series My Little Pony: Friendship Is Magic, typically an adult male."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
